    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/1505-universite-sanayi-isbirligi-destek-programi/\nTITLE: 1505 – Üniversite-Sanayi İşbirliği Destek Programı – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:56:08.758167\nCONTENT_HASH: 2b576b36bf75f4092b82b58ba8abf41b3cb05b7c78283349bb050c97d97d6975",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_2b576b36bf.txt",
    "page": null,
