    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/tubitak/\nTITLE: TÜBİTAK – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:54:49.653388\nCONTENT_HASH: 35463a9d627a1cb5eac40cb574657d970dcc41823a4c0cb0285c8ab05a7f9a78",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_35463a9d62.txt",
