    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/ulusal-proje-destek-birimi/\nTITLE: Ulusal Proje Destek Birimi – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:59:02.516300\nCONTENT_HASH: 42de313ae8a3005cde58de41507d9e9f614503b65f7002463ab3a3219910e3e6",
