    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/cost\nTITLE: SÜ Araştırma Dekanlığı Etkinlik Kayıt Formu\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:59:51.901012\nCONTENT_HASH: 6af582b38c63ca505f00a8dc02292c9e8fd9da311ee9078550cf5a1ae5bbaacd",
