    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/2025-b-01-b-grubu-proje-destek-programi/\nTITLE: 2025-B-01 B Grubu Proje Destek Programı – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:56:13.535621\nCONTENT_HASH: c94ce6b281bfca629c3705fbe63cacc0ac55a26047e4ae32a6b5b27512918629",
