    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/erc-2026-starting-grant-cagrisi/\nTITLE: ERC 2026 Starting Grant Çağrısı – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:57:48.002515\nCONTENT_HASH: cdc6423b3f4aeaf508fc4ab9911e3b4f70faf9f5d9c709633c8ae60ca71e31bc",
