  },
  {
    "id": "e59a77f48afe47c6b0539ca59c467cad",
    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/selcuk-university-a-strong-partner-for-global-collaboration-and-innovation/\nTITLE: Selcuk University: A Strong Partner for Global Collaboration and Innovation – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:52:54.005931\nCONTENT_HASH: ce3e6d11e24e63bb5624034a8cf5950d94bb38ea54be4e68bb022b6b04c9d19a",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "3e0ddb5713ab4e89af32fff48274d7cf",
    "content": "Selcuk University: A Strong Partner for Global Collaboration and Innovation – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nAralık Ayı Bülteni\n360 ARDEK\nAra\nBizi Takip Et\n© ARDEK Tüm Hakları Saklıdır.\nSELCUK UNIVERSITY: A STRONG PARTNER FOR GLOBAL COLLABORATION AND INNOVATION\nSelçuk University,\nfounded in Konya in 1975, is one of Türkiye’s oldest and most versatile institutions of higher education with a mission to pioneer scientific, technological and social progress. Since its establishment, the university has",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 2
  },
  {
    "id": "fe8df563a4414add912d411fb1feeec9",
    "content": "education with a mission to pioneer scientific, technological and social progress. Since its establishment, the university has made a name for itself with its international research and education activities and offers a highly favorable environment for the development of interdisciplinary projects with its diverse faculties and institutes. Below, the main features and privileged aspects of Selçuk University are detailed as a guide for institutions aiming to cooperate in project market and partnership platf",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 3
  },
  {
    "id": "d676b89553cc46a8aa63bfa08576dd8a",
    "content": "spects of Selçuk University are detailed as a guide for institutions aiming to cooperate in project market and partnership platforms.\n1. Broad Academic Spectrum and Interdisciplinary Perspective\n– A rich selection of faculties and departments:\nThe university has more than 20 faculties and numerous departments, including Engineering, Architecture, Medicine, Pharmacy, Veterinary Medicine, Agriculture, Arts and Sciences, Social Sciences and Fine Arts. This diversity allows different disciplines to work in an i",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 4
  },
  {
    "id": "7c4f8d9180414308ba7634c6fad58078",
    "content": "cine, Agriculture, Arts and Sciences, Social Sciences and Fine Arts. This diversity allows different disciplines to work in an integrated manner on international projects.\n– Graduate and Specialization Programs:\nInstitutes in different fields such as Social Sciences, Natural Sciences, Health Sciences, Educational Sciences and Islamic Sciences offer a wide range of programs for advanced research at the graduate level. These programs strengthen the scientific infrastructure of international projects by prepar",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "e8acf8b27d544e7aafc00c4ac4bae0ad",
    "content": "nced research at the graduate level. These programs strengthen the scientific infrastructure of international projects by preparing the ground for academic studies that blend theoretical knowledge and practice.\n2. Research, Development and Technology Transfer Ecosystem\n– Research Centers and Centers of Excellence:\n– Agriculture and Food Technologies:\nKonya, as a region with intensive agricultural production, is a strategic location for projects in food security and sustainable agriculture. Selçuk University",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 6
  },
  {
    "id": "d83e2b41957043f0bb4a2e4f8e1dc0af",
    "content": "ve agricultural production, is a strategic location for projects in food security and sustainable agriculture. Selçuk University’s relevant research centers are highly successful in combining local agricultural experience with global R&D activities.\n– Advanced Technologies (Nanotechnology, Biotechnology, Artificial Intelligence):\nWith advanced laboratories and research infrastructures, joint R&D projects are carried out in promising areas such as nanomaterials, bioinformatics, medical imaging and intelligen",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 7
  },
  {
    "id": "061832b5c0ed464592f5d578de5be61b",
    "content": "res, joint R&D projects are carried out in promising areas such as nanomaterials, bioinformatics, medical imaging and intelligent systems.\n– Health Sciences and Clinical Research:\nWith its state-of-the-art hospital and clinical research units, the Faculty of Medicine provides academic leadership, particularly in drug and medical device development, oncology and public health.\n– Technology Transfer Office (TTO):\n– Selçuk University TTO provides comprehensive support from the idea stage of projects to the com",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 8
  },
  {
    "id": "427d8523fc7941c0a34dc71b3769b20e",
    "content": "hnology Transfer Office (TTO):\n– Selçuk University TTO provides comprehensive support from the idea stage of projects to the commercialization process. Thanks to its staff specialized in patent, licensing and innovation management, it enables international stakeholders to quickly implement their projects.\n– By acting as a bridge between researchers and industry representatives, it facilitates the integration of university resources into the real sector.\n– Teknokent and Incubation Centers:\n– The Teknokent, w",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 9
  },
  {
    "id": "a25ac922f9a44a7d848cd8aecfce6a49",
    "content": "facilitates the integration of university resources into the real sector.\n– Teknokent and Incubation Centers:\n– The Teknokent, which operates on the university campus, hosts a large number of start-ups and R&D companies, particularly in the fields of software, biotechnology and advanced materials. This ecosystem enables strong connections with international investors and institutions.\n– Incubation centers grow new initiatives and early-stage technological ideas with mentorship and infrastructure support, an",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 10
  },
  {
    "id": "bbb33157b2814ba5bc69e1579d773be7",
    "content": "ns.\n– Incubation centers grow new initiatives and early-stage technological ideas with mentorship and infrastructure support, and facilitate projects to become internationally competitive.\n3. International Cooperation and Multidimensional Partnerships\n– Erasmus+ and Exchange Programs:\nErasmus+ agreements with leading European universities foster student and academic mobility and a culture of joint projects. These collaborations open the door to interdisciplinary research and increase the visibility of the u",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 11
  },
  {
    "id": "89003476e71340d6b21de2dc0db00f27",
    "content": "culture of joint projects. These collaborations open the door to interdisciplinary research and increase the visibility of the university on international platforms.\n– Bilateral Agreements and Global Networks:\nThe protocols signed with various universities and research institutions in Europe, Asia, the Middle East and the Americas provide the opportunity to carry out bilateral projects, organize academic events and publish joint publications. This network has made Selçuk University one of the important acto",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 12
  },
  {
    "id": "e0752e7dab5640e0bf2923bfaf832dc4",
    "content": "ects, organize academic events and publish joint publications. This network has made Selçuk University one of the important actors of the global R&D ecosystem.\n– Project Management Experience:\nThe university has a large project portfolio and experienced teams within the scope of European Union framework programs (Horizon 2020, Horizon Europe, etc.), United Nations Development Program (UNDP) and other international funds. Institutions and researchers seeking funding can integrate their projects with the univ",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 13
  },
  {
    "id": "5094b1de00cb49af9deaca2a957cb3a2",
    "content": "am (UNDP) and other international funds. Institutions and researchers seeking funding can integrate their projects with the university’s solid management skills to ensure success.\n4. Interaction with the Sector and High Added Value Projects\n– Industrial Partnerships and Consortia:\nKonya, with its large manufacturing sector and agricultural infrastructure, is a productive region for innovative project ideas. Selçuk University is able to rapidly adapt its academic knowledge to the needs of the real sector thr",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 14
  },
  {
    "id": "9501d201605e4d33b94ec8d15f959188",
    "content": "innovative project ideas. Selçuk University is able to rapidly adapt its academic knowledge to the needs of the real sector through strategic collaborations with local and international companies.\n– Commercialization of R&D Projects:\nThrough TTO and Teknokent, successful research projects are rapidly transferred to the prototype stage and commercialized. The University offers effective solutions to its partners by providing guidance at every stage, from the management of intellectual and industrial propert",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 15
  },
  {
    "id": "c392a155a0014b9f80c66acd8d808dd8",
    "content": "ctive solutions to its partners by providing guidance at every stage, from the management of intellectual and industrial property rights to market analysis.\n5. Konya’s Strategic Advantage and Cultural Richness\n– Location and Transportation:\nLocated in the center of Türkiye, Konya is connected to major centers by rail and road networks. This strategic location provides logistical convenience for project activities and facilitates access to the city for international stakeholders.\n– Historical and Cultural Ri",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 16
  },
  {
    "id": "f04e1dd63ae94399ba39338bd281fee7",
    "content": "nvenience for project activities and facilitates access to the city for international stakeholders.\n– Historical and Cultural Richness:\nKonya, the city of Mevlânâ Celâleddîn-i Rûmî, has been a center of cultural interaction for centuries. Foreign researchers and students can benefit from the rich cultural heritage as well as a peaceful living environment and have a productive academic experience.\n– International Student Profile and Multilingual Opportunities:\nSelçuk University hosts students and academics f",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 17
  },
  {
    "id": "d17bcd4e24244c61ac86d9cc7519f8cc",
    "content": "mic experience.\n– International Student Profile and Multilingual Opportunities:\nSelçuk University hosts students and academics from all over the world every year, creating a multicultural atmosphere throughout the campus. There are departments and language centers that provide education in foreign languages, especially English.\n6. Strategic Goals for the Future\n– Sustainability and Social Impact:\nThe University supports next-generation projects in areas such as energy efficiency, clean production technologi",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 18
  },
  {
    "id": "87b53f3796ec4d248c50a200ad8bd7d9",
    "content": "Social Impact:\nThe University supports next-generation projects in areas such as energy efficiency, clean production technologies and environmentally friendly approaches. Pressing issues such as the global climate crisis and sustainable food supply are high on the University’s strategic research agenda.\n– Digital Transformation and Smart Systems:\nSelçuk University carries out numerous projects in areas such as artificial intelligence-supported applications, big data analysis, cyber security and digital hea",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 19
  },
  {
    "id": "86353f316a1b48b8bc40797cdbda40d0",
    "content": "rous projects in areas such as artificial intelligence-supported applications, big data analysis, cyber security and digital health platforms. These projects are growing and increasing their impact thanks to multidisciplinary research consortia established with international partners.\n– Deepening Interaction with Society and Industry:\nThe University considers it a strategic priority to develop integrated projects with public institutions and the private sector. Thus, it is aimed to rapidly realize research",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 20
  },
  {
    "id": "ab91904657f443ee8bc0ce53f266b87c",
    "content": "y to develop integrated projects with public institutions and the private sector. Thus, it is aimed to rapidly realize research results and provide sustainable benefits to society.\nWith its roots dating back to the second half of the 20th century, Selçuk University, which stands out with its academic diversity and strong R&D ecosystem, maintains its position as\na reliable and dynamic stakeholder in international project partnerships\n. Its visionary approach that brings together various disciplines, its know",
