    "content": "ic stakeholder in international project partnerships\n. Its visionary approach that brings together various disciplines, its know-how in technology transfer and applied research are among the most important elements that differentiate the university in project markets.\nInstitutions interested in new collaborations and joint projects can quickly access the following within Selçuk University\n– Interdisciplinary research networks,\n– Advanced laboratory infrastructures,\n– Technology transfer and commercializatio",
    "source": "ardek.selcuk.edu.tr_ce3e6d11e2.txt",
