    "content": "versity\n– Interdisciplinary research networks,\n– Advanced laboratory infrastructures,\n– Technology transfer and commercialization opportunities,\n– Expert teams with international project experience\nOn this occasion, we invite all institutions and researchers who value academic excellence and global impact-oriented projects to develop\npermanent and innovative collaborations\nunder the roof of Selçuk University.\nTekrar Hoş Geldiniz!\nHesabınıza giriş yapın\nKullanıcı Adı veya E-posta Adresi\nŞifre\nBeni hatırla\nŞi",
