    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/ab-programlari/\nTITLE: AB PROGRAMLARI – Selçuk Üniversitesi Araştırma Dekanlığı\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:56:53.456823\nCONTENT_HASH: d3ea0f83b2bfc15ae6f5501423b616362dcb95f9ca2ed7afd79a4d91439048a7",
