    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/bilimselmakaleII\nTITLE: Bilimsel Makale Atölyesi-II Kayıt Formu\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:59:43.119945\nCONTENT_HASH: f3c60bb7e32beebac95b8caafefc5d0167230835986c86e73b26181975957e22",
