    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://ardek.selcuk.edu.tr/dokuman/Burs%20ve%20Destekler%20Tamam%C4%B1%20-%20%C3%96nlisans.pdf\nTITLE: \nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T00:59:43.018704\nCONTENT_HASH: ff655e3ac841394325043fb209ad28548a8b6e135e53a1645286d5d4324e80e0",
