  {
    "id": "b92b1e3ee0b3476da1eaf73a9984ff11",
    "content": "Akşehir Müzesi, Philomelion, Takı, Bilezik, Bronz Eser, Metal Eser, Demir Çağı.\nBanka, Banka Personeli, Performans Değerlemesi, Personelin Performans Değerlemesine Bakış Açısı\nBulanık Analitik Hiyerarşi Süreci\nEnergy Consumption\nKOBİ’ler, Küreselleşme, Sosyo-Ekonomik Sistem, İstihdam\nKonya\nKriz Yönetimi\nKültür Turizmi\nTurizm\nTutum\nTüketim\nTüketim Davranışları, Tüketim Fonksiyonları, Gelir Esnekliği\nTürkiye Selçukluları\nVerimlilik, Hastane, Modern Yönetim Felsefesi\ndilbilimsel hibridite\nedebi çeviri\nsömürgec",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 3
  },
  {
    "id": "abb3b05619594ce8aee8459d46c462b0",
    "content": ", Gelir Esnekliği\nTürkiye Selçukluları\nVerimlilik, Hastane, Modern Yönetim Felsefesi\ndilbilimsel hibridite\nedebi çeviri\nsömürgecilik sonrası yazın\nyemek kültürü\nyeniden sömürgeleştirme\nÇalışan Memnuniyeti\nAna Sayfa\nHakkında\nKullanıcı\nKayıt\nAra\nSon Sayı\nArşiv\nDuyurular\nDergipark Sayfamız\nYazım Kuralları\nAna Sayfa\n>\nSayı 56\n>\nCEYLAN APAYDIN\nTelevision Series and the Construcion of Society and Gender Roles: The Case of the ‘Kızılcık Şerbeti’ Series in the Context of the Relationship Between Secular Women and C",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 4
  },
  {
    "id": "fd0fa20f1459452985c538ad95413b36",
    "content": "ciety and Gender Roles: The Case of the ‘Kızılcık Şerbeti’ Series in the Context of the Relationship Between Secular Women and Conservative Men\nŞebnem CEYLAN APAYDIN\nÖz\nTelevision series, which are effective in shaping gender roles and family structure, have a key role in supporting and rebuilding social change. The existing social structure can be supported with television series, as well as the differences in the society can be shown with extreme examples by creating conflicts with the concern of being wa",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "2d3133c004fe43248bff08e50fe2f50d",
    "content": "as well as the differences in the society can be shown with extreme examples by creating conflicts with the concern of being watched, and the opinion that change is necessary can be created with series that are not always compatible with the social structure. Such series can strengthen the gender inequality that exists in society, as well as cause characters that are not included in the ideal family structure to be pushed out of society. In this study, which aims to reveal the effects of television series",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 6
  },
  {
    "id": "b17f7e1e02fd4110852acb2fa5d2eaca",
    "content": "in the ideal family structure to be pushed out of society. In this study, which aims to reveal the effects of television series on the reconstruction of society, gender roles are discussed within the framework of conservative and secular identity. Within the scope of the study, the three episodes of the first season of the\nKızılcık Şerbeti\nseries, which are in the mainstream media, were analyzed using the content analysis method. In the sections examined, it can be said that secular women represented in soc",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 7
  },
  {
    "id": "49bb60510752435a955000869b21147e",
    "content": "were analyzed using the content analysis method. In the sections examined, it can be said that secular women represented in society than conservative ones due to their family structures, and conservative men are shown as stronger and wealthier than secular men. As a result of the study,\nKızılcık Şerbeti\ncan be considered not only as a means of entertainment but also as an important cultural text that questions gender dynamics. Such series, which also contain elements that can reinforce stereotypes and incr",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 8
  },
  {
    "id": "3ede61bc24ba4feb86f4335bae4b443d",
    "content": "t cultural text that questions gender dynamics. Such series, which also contain elements that can reinforce stereotypes and increase social tensions, can play an important role in shaping the values and norms of society and provide viewers with new perspectives.\nAnahtar Kelimeler\nTelevision Series, Conservatism, Secularism, Family Dynamics, Building Society\nTam Metin:\nPDF\nReferanslar\nBaş, E. (2019). Türk Melodram Filmlerinde İdeal/ Kötü Kadın İmgesi: Bir Demet Menekşe Film Örneği. Uluslararası Sosyal Araştı",
    "source": "dergisosyalbil.selcuk.edu.tr_039e0584ca.txt",
    "page": null,
    "chunk": 9
  },
