    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://hayvanhastanesi.selcuk.edu.tr//doktorlarimiz.php\nTITLE: Selçuk Üniversitesi Hayvan Hastanesi\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T01:00:13.935299\nCONTENT_HASH: 8f5cf97d475856d6278308ee168afef273772e86fe0e115c83c1ccc832e16041",
