    "content": "SOURCE_URL: https://robotikcerrahi.selcuk.edu.tr/hastanemiz.php\nTITLE: Da Vinci Robotik Cerrahi - Selçuk Üniversitesi Tıp Fakültesi Hastanesi\nSCRAPED_AT: 2026-01-17T01:00:13.252343\nCONTENT_HASH: 09d3ccc1619ed85ae92cd532587bfeafa900307472e4cc77105e4d8f9ec3aac4",
